BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-21T00:55:00&endDate=2026-11-21T05:30:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nNORTHERN LINE: On the early mornings of Saturday 21 and Sunday 22 November\, no Night Tube service between Kennington and Stockwell. Please use Night Bus Route N155 between Kennington\, Oval and Stockwell. For travel between Central London and stations between Stockwell and Morden\, use Victoria line connections via Stockwell.
